    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by section 6(2) (b) and section 21(2) (b) of the Town and Country Planning Ordinance (Chapter 269), I, Anura Karunathilake, Minister of Urban Development, Construction and Housing do by this Order -",
