      55.25,
      556.06,
      549.77,
      579.13
    ],
    "text": "(a) declare that the area of land called as \"Asgiriya Raja Maha Viharaya\" speci\ufb01 ed in the Schedule hereto shall be an urban development area for the purpose of the aforesaid Ordinance; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
